### Health check
GET http://localhost:8666/api/health

### Create a household member
POST http://localhost:8666/api/household-member
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "countryOfResidence": "Switzerland",
  "countryOfEmployment": "Switzerland",
  "averageMonthlySalary": 6000.00,
  "currentCash": 15000.00
}

### List household members
GET http://localhost:8666/api/household-member

### Create a cashflow
POST http://localhost:8666/api/cashflow
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 150.00,
  "month": "JULY",
  "label": "Electricity bill",
  "cashflowType": "MONTHLY",
  "direction": "OUTFLOW",
  "cashflowSheetId": 1
}

### List cashflows
GET http://localhost:8666/api/cashflows

### Create a cashflow sheet
POST http://localhost:8666/api/cashflow-sheet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sheetName": "Sept budget",
  "owner": "admin",
  "type": "MONTHLY"
}

### List cashflow sheets for an owner
GET http://localhost:8666/api/cashflow-sheets?owner=admin
